Our travel policy is to book flights at least **14 days ahead**; fly **economy** for trips under 6 hours and **premium economy** for trips over 6 hours; keep hotel costs to **€180/night in Berlin** or **€220/night in London**; and submit receipts in the expense tool within **30 days**. [1](http://127.0.0.1:3000/record/865a751f-8ff1-4262-ab1c-1bdffcb85cbd/preview#blockIndex=0)

